{"spread": 37, "blocks": [[{"t": "Commissioning was sequenced by ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 61, 625, 75]}, {"t": "zone so early move-ins could begin ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 73, 629, 87]}, {"t": "while fine-tuning continued elsewhere.", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 85, 645, 99]}], [{"t": "Beating the clock without ", "font": "Roboto-Bold", "size": 14.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 109, 619, 128]}, {"t": "compromising quality", "font": "Roboto-Bold", "size": 14.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 123, 593, 142]}], [{"t": "Work began in March 2024 with a mid-", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 151, 641, 165]}, {"t": "year opening target. Mint responded ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 163, 637, 177]}, {"t": "with parallel sequencing. Electrical, ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 175, 629, 189]}, {"t": "ACMV, plumbing, and fire trades ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 187, 611, 201]}, {"t": "progressed side by side. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 199, 577, 213]}, {"t": "When structural teams opened the ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 211, 628, 225]}, {"t": "slab for a riser, Mint installed ducting ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 223, 638, 237]}, {"t": "above at the same time to maintain ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 235, 630, 249]}, {"t": "pace.", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 247, 483, 261]}, {"t": "\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 259, 459, 273]}, {"t": "Long-lead items were ordered early ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 271, 630, 285]}, {"t": "to keep the programme on track. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 283, 617, 297]}, {"t": "Daily stand-ups aligned teams and ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 295, 627, 309]}, {"t": "embedded quality checks. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 307, 587, 321]}], [{"t": "Off-site testing and pre-commissioning ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 331, 649, 345]}, {"t": "compressed later stages. By mid-2024, ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 343, 647, 357]}, {"t": "BeyondX reopened on schedule. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 355, 616, 369]}], [{"t": "It is now a benchmark for adaptive ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 379, 626, 393]}, {"t": "reuse: a heritage shell that powers ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 391, 626, 405]}, {"t": "innovation while keeping its original ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 403, 631, 417]}, {"t": "character in plain sight.", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#0F222E", "bbox": [456, 415, 570, 429]}]]}